                                    text="&lt;p>The AbbVie Foundation is a US based 501(c)(3) nonprofit working to drive transformative change in communities worldwide to help people live their healthiest life. The Foundation is committed to advancing health equity in communities through partnerships and AbbVie employee impact programmes around the world.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
