                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                    text="&lt;p>AbbVie employees are passionate about making a difference in their communities. Our employees give generously of their time, expertise and resources to deliver on our shared purpose and deepen our collective impact.&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;Our employees directly support the AbbVie Foundation’s mission to advance health equity through our industry-leading giving, volunteering and employee support programmes.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
